# Data (runtime state — never commit)
# Catch-all: every generated artifact under data/ is runtime state (caches,
# calibration, backtest output, SQLite sidecars). Add explicit allow-lists
# (!data/<name>) if anything in data/ ever needs to be tracked.
data/**
logs/

